<h1 class="dawn-title" id="dawn-title">A little more space for <span class="dawn-mark">what matters.<svg class="dawn-spark" viewBox="0 0 30 30" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#f1c24f" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 4l4 7"/><path d="M14 13l11-4"/><path d="M14 20l12 3"/></svg></span></h1>
<p class="dawn-lead">Before the noise, there is room to think, to wander, and simply to enjoy the moment.</p>
</div>
<p class="dawn-caption" data-caption=".15,.175,.25,.275">It starts with just one.</p>
<p class="dawn-caption" data-caption=".33,.355,.445,.47">Then another. And another.</p>
<p class="dawn-caption dawn-caption-dark" data-caption=".715,.74,.825,.85">Until the moment slips away.</p>
<div class="dawn-cue" data-show="false" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dawn-cue-mark"><i></i></span><span>Scroll to discover</span></div>
<p class="sr-only" id="dawn-description">An illustrated story. A person rests on a rock under a tree at sunrise. One short video appears, then another; the threads of their attention are pulled from the sun, a flower and the tree towards the videos. A storm of videos circles them, the landscape fades to dark, and only one thread of light remains.</p>
